  "details": "So I have noticed that when I’m large instances 50+ users, sometimes the safety settings won’t apply to all the users in the instance, for example, when I am at a club world, I will usually turn my safety settings down all the way, so I only see my friends as it can get very laggy (even with good hardware). However I’ve noticed some users are still having their avatar shown, despite when selecting them, it shows “displaying safety preferences” even thought my safety settings should hide them. I know this was a bug pre EAC update, I have not checked wether it is still in the game.",
